#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:16
msgid "1. Visual Theme & Atmosphere"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:18
msgid ""
"Claude's interface is a literary salon reimagined as a product page — "
"warm, unhurried, and quietly intellectual. The entire experience is built"
" on a parchment-toned canvas (`#f5f4ed`) that deliberately evokes the "
"feeling of high-quality paper rather than a digital surface. Where most "
"AI product pages lean into cold, futuristic aesthetics, Claude's design "
"radiates human warmth, as if the AI itself has good taste in interior "
"design."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:20
msgid ""
"The signature move is the custom Anthropic Serif typeface — a medium-"
"weight serif with generous proportions that gives every headline the "
"gravitas of a book title. Combined with organic, hand-drawn-feeling "
"illustrations in terracotta (`#c96442`), black, and muted green, the "
"visual language says \"thoughtful companion\" rather than \"powerful "
"tool.\" The serif headlines breathe at tight-but-comfortable line-heights"
" (1.10–1.30), creating a cadence that feels more like reading an essay "
"than scanning a product page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:22
msgid ""
"What makes Claude's design truly distinctive is its warm neutral palette."
" Every gray has a yellow-brown undertone (`#5e5d59`, `#87867f`, "
"`#4d4c48`) — there are no cool blue-grays anywhere. Borders are cream-"
"tinted (`#f0eee6`, `#e8e6dc`), shadows use warm transparent blacks, and "
"even the darkest surfaces (`#141413`, `#30302e`) carry a barely "
"perceptible olive warmth. This chromatic consistency creates a space that"
" feels lived-in and trustworthy."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:24
msgid "**Key Characteristics:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:25
msgid "Warm parchment canvas (`#f5f4ed`) evoking premium paper, not screens"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:26
msgid ""
"Custom Anthropic type family: Serif for headlines, Sans for UI, Mono for "
"code"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:27
msgid "Terracotta brand accent (`#c96442`) — warm, earthy, deliberately un-tech"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:28
msgid "Exclusively warm-toned neutrals — every gray has a yellow-brown undertone"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:29
msgid "Organic, editorial illustrations replacing typical tech iconography"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:30
msgid ""
"Ring-based shadow system (`0px 0px 0px 1px`) creating border-like depth "
"without visible borders"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:31
msgid ""
"Magazine-like pacing with generous section spacing and serif-driven "
"hierarchy"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:33
msgid "2. Color Palette & Roles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:35
msgid "Primary"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:36
msgid ""
"**Anthropic Near Black** (`#141413`): The primary text color and dark-"
"theme surface — not pure black but a warm, almost olive-tinted dark "
"that's gentler on the eyes. The warmest \"black\" in any major tech "
"brand."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:37
msgid ""
"**Terracotta Brand** (`#c96442`): The core brand color — a burnt orange-"
"brown used for primary CTA buttons, brand moments, and the signature "
"accent. Deliberately earthy and un-tech."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:38
msgid ""
"**Coral Accent** (`#d97757`): A lighter, warmer variant of the brand "
"color used for text accents, links on dark surfaces, and secondary "
"emphasis."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:40
msgid "Secondary & Accent"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:41
msgid ""
"**Error Crimson** (`#b53333`): A deep, warm red for error states — "
"serious without being alarming."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:42
msgid ""
"**Focus Blue** (`#3898ec`): Standard blue for input focus rings — the "
"only cool color in the entire system, used purely for accessibility."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:44
msgid "Surface & Background"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:45
msgid ""
"**Parchment** (`#f5f4ed`): The primary page background — a warm cream "
"with a yellow-green tint that feels like aged paper. The emotional "
"foundation of the entire design."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:46
msgid ""
"**Ivory** (`#faf9f5`): The lightest surface — used for cards and elevated"
" containers on the Parchment background. Barely distinguishable but "
"creates subtle layering."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:47
msgid ""
"**Pure White** (`#ffffff`): Reserved for specific button surfaces and "
"maximum-contrast elements."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:48
msgid ""
"**Warm Sand** (`#e8e6dc`): Button backgrounds and prominent interactive "
"surfaces — a noticeably warm light gray."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:49
msgid ""
"**Dark Surface** (`#30302e`): Dark-theme containers, nav borders, and "
"elevated dark elements — warm charcoal."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:50
msgid ""
"**Deep Dark** (`#141413`): Dark-theme page background and primary dark "
"surface."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:52
msgid "Neutrals & Text"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:53
msgid ""
"**Charcoal Warm** (`#4d4c48`): Button text on light warm surfaces — the "
"go-to dark-on-light text."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:54
msgid ""
"**Olive Gray** (`#5e5d59`): Secondary body text — a distinctly warm "
"medium-dark gray."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:55
msgid ""
"**Stone Gray** (`#87867f`): Tertiary text, footnotes, and de-emphasized "
"metadata."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:56
msgid "**Dark Warm** (`#3d3d3a`): Dark text links and emphasized secondary text."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:57
msgid ""
"**Warm Silver** (`#b0aea5`): Text on dark surfaces — a warm, parchment-"
"tinted light gray."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:59
msgid "Semantic & Accent"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:60
msgid ""
"**Border Cream** (`#f0eee6`): Standard light-theme border — barely "
"visible warm cream, creating the gentlest possible containment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:61
msgid ""
"**Border Warm** (`#e8e6dc`): Prominent borders, section dividers, and "
"emphasized containment on light surfaces."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:62
msgid ""
"**Border Dark** (`#30302e`): Standard border on dark surfaces — maintains"
" the warm tone."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:63
msgid ""
"**Ring Warm** (`#d1cfc5`): Shadow ring color for button hover/focus "
"states."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:64
msgid ""
"**Ring Subtle** (`#dedc01`): Secondary ring variant for lighter "
"interactive surfaces."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:65
msgid "**Ring Deep** (`#c2c0b6`): Deeper ring for active/pressed states."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:67
msgid "Gradient System"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:68
msgid ""
"Claude's design is **gradient-free** in the traditional sense. Depth and "
"visual richness come from the interplay of warm surface tones, organic "
"illustrations, and light/dark section alternation. The warm palette "
"itself creates a \"gradient\" effect as the eye moves through cream → "
"sand → stone → charcoal → black sections."
msgstr ""

