#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:213
msgid "Whitespace Philosophy"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:214
msgid ""
"**Editorial pacing**: Each section breathes like a magazine spread — "
"generous top/bottom margins create natural reading pauses."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:215
msgid ""
"**Serif-driven rhythm**: The serif headings establish a literary cadence "
"that demands more whitespace than sans-serif designs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:216
msgid ""
"**Content island approach**: Sections alternate between light and dark "
"environments, creating distinct \"rooms\" for each message."
msgstr ""

