#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:227
msgid "6. Depth & Elevation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md
msgid "Level"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md
msgid "Treatment"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md
msgid "Use"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md
msgid "Flat (Level 0)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md
msgid "No shadow, no border"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md
msgid "Parchment background, inline text"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md
msgid "Contained (Level 1)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md
msgid "`1px solid #f0eee6` (light) or `1px solid #30302e` (dark)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md
msgid "Standard cards, sections"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md
msgid "Ring (Level 2)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md
msgid "`0px 0px 0px 1px` ring shadows using warm grays"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md
msgid "Interactive cards, buttons, hover states"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md
msgid "Whisper (Level 3)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md
msgid "`rgba(0,0,0,0.05) 0px 4px 24px`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md
msgid "Elevated feature cards, product screenshots"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md
msgid "Inset (Level 4)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md
#, python-format
msgid "`inset 0px 0px 0px 1px` at 15% opacity"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md
msgid "Active/pressed button states"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:237
msgid ""
"**Shadow Philosophy**: Claude communicates depth through **warm-toned "
"ring shadows** rather than traditional drop shadows. The signature `0px "
"0px 0px 1px` pattern creates a border-like halo that's softer than an "
"actual border — it's a shadow pretending to be a border, or a border "
"that's technically a shadow. When drop shadows do appear, they're "
"extremely soft (0.05 opacity, 24px blur) — barely visible lifts that "
"suggest floating rather than casting."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:239
msgid "Decorative Depth"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:240
msgid ""
"**Light/Dark alternation**: The most dramatic depth effect comes from "
"alternating between Parchment (`#f5f4ed`) and Near Black (`#141413`) "
"sections — entire sections shift elevation by changing the ambient light "
"level."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:241
msgid ""
"**Warm ring halos**: Button and card interactions use ring shadows that "
"match the warm palette — never cool-toned or generic gray."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:243
msgid "7. Do's and Don'ts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:245
msgid "Do"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:246
msgid ""
"Use Parchment (`#f5f4ed`) as the primary light background — the warm "
"cream tone IS the Claude personality"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:247
msgid ""
"Use Anthropic Serif at weight 500 for all headlines — the single-weight "
"consistency is intentional"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:248
msgid ""
"Use Terracotta Brand (`#c96442`) only for primary CTAs and the highest-"
"signal brand moments"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:249
msgid ""
"Keep all neutrals warm-toned — every gray should have a yellow-brown "
"undertone"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:250
msgid ""
"Use ring shadows (`0px 0px 0px 1px`) for interactive element states "
"instead of drop shadows"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:251
msgid ""
"Maintain the editorial serif/sans hierarchy — serif for content "
"headlines, sans for UI"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:252
msgid "Use generous body line-height (1.60) for a literary reading experience"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:253
msgid ""
"Alternate between light and dark sections to create chapter-like page "
"rhythm"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:254
msgid "Apply generous border-radius (12–32px) for a soft, approachable feel"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:256
msgid "Don't"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:257
msgid "Don't use cool blue-grays anywhere — the palette is exclusively warm-toned"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:258
msgid ""
"Don't use bold (700+) weight on Anthropic Serif — weight 500 is the "
"ceiling for serifs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:259
msgid ""
"Don't introduce saturated colors beyond Terracotta — the palette is "
"deliberately muted"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:260
msgid ""
"Don't use sharp corners (< 6px radius) on buttons or cards — softness is "
"core to the identity"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:261
msgid ""
"Don't apply heavy drop shadows — depth comes from ring shadows and "
"background color shifts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:262
msgid ""
"Don't use pure white (`#ffffff`) as a page background — Parchment "
"(`#f5f4ed`) or Ivory (`#faf9f5`) are always warmer"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:263
msgid ""
"Don't use geometric/tech-style illustrations — Claude's illustrations are"
" organic and hand-drawn-feeling"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:264
msgid ""
"Don't reduce body line-height below 1.40 — the generous spacing supports "
"the editorial personality"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:265
msgid ""
"Don't use monospace fonts for non-code content — Anthropic Mono is "
"strictly for code"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_claude.md:266
msgid ""
"Don't mix in sans-serif for headlines — the serif/sans split is the "
"typographic identity"
msgstr ""

